# Backend

Use explicit types (no `var`). Nullable reference types on. Handlers, validators, and MediatR behaviors are assembly-scanned — do not register each handler by hand.

## Application slice

```
Features/<Area>/<Feature>/
  Commands/  Queries/  Handlers/  DTOs/  Mappings/  Validators/
```

- Command/query: `record ... : IRequest<Result<TDto>>` (or `Result<PagedResult<TDto>>`)
- Mapper: static `ToDto` / `ToDtos` / `ToEntity` / `UpdateFromCommand` — pass related aggregates as arguments (navigations may be unloaded)
- Validator: FluentValidation on every command/query with input
- Handler: load via repository → domain method → `IUnitOfWork` / `IFloorballUnitOfWork` / `IFootballUnitOfWork` / `IHockeyUnitOfWork` → map → `Result<T>.Success`
- Expected failures: `Result<T>.Failure(...)` or `Result<T>.NotFound(name, key)`. Catch only the exception types that can actually happen (`InvalidOperationException`, `ArgumentException`, `OperationCanceledException` rethrow). Do not use `catch (Exception)` or a bare `catch` unless there is no more specific type.

## Domain

Entities inherit `BaseEntity` (`Id`, `CreatedAt`, `UpdatedAt`). Private setters, private ORM ctor, public constructor + named methods for state changes. Value objects are immutable records with validation. Repository interfaces live in `Domain/Repositories/{Common|Floorball|Football|Hockey}`. Update `DomainGlossary.md` when adding terms.

## WebAPI

Inherit `BaseApiController`. Map request → MediatR → `HandleResult` / `HandlePaginatedResult` / `HandleListResult` / `HandleVoidResult`. Wrap payloads in `ApiResponse<T>` / `PaginatedApiResponse<T>`. Mutations: `[Authorize(Roles = AuthRoles.AdminOnly)]` or `ClubAdminOrAdmin`. XML comments on actions (OpenAPI). Log with structured properties; sanitize user strings via `SanitizeForLog`.

```csharp
Result<ClubDto> result = await _mediator.Send(new GetClubByIdQuery(id));
return HandleResult(result, "Club retrieved successfully", "Club not found");
```
